\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl200\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  1.  \cf0  Jesus have taken me as a friend today;
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0\qj My soul keeps rejoicing that I am for Christ;
\par With a new love I will always serve my Jesus
\par And receive His life everlasting.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.   In Jesus shall I have everlasting Joy,
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0\qj Lust on earth in no time shall be passed away.
\par If I know anything in this time of my life
\par That is Jesus Christ and His Gospel.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.   The Good Shepherd I know, protects all His flock.
\par \pard       When some flocks get missing, He searches with love.
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0\qj\cf1  \cf0 It is from His pity, and it's from His mercy
\par That He used to keep watch on His flocks.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl200\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  I am a little lamb, that stays with Jesus
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0\qj  He calls my name always, and gives me His love
\par  What then can take me away from my Jesus Christ?
\par \pard      Yes, Jesus has taken me a friend.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

